{
  "_doc": "The news feeds redlines/news.py polls, one per line. `ai_only`: the publisher already filters the feed to AI (false sends each item through the Jev AI gate). `open_access`: articles read without a subscription (milestone 2 reads their full text). `resolve`: how to turn the feed's links into the publisher's URL (google_news: the link is a Google redirect). Probed from airo-dev 2026-10-13.",
